WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:02.420
Now, then.

00:02.420 --> 00:05.650
Here's to our new research students.

00:05.650 --> 00:07.190
Cheers!

00:07.450 --> 00:09.400
Cheers!

00:10.720 --> 00:13.340
<i>Hey there. It's me, Haruto C.</i>

00:13.340 --> 00:15.850
<i>A lot happened last time,</i>

00:15.850 --> 00:18.370
<i>but now we're having a welcome 
party for the newcomers.</i>

00:18.370 --> 00:20.830
Welcome to my research lab!

00:20.830 --> 00:22.780
Go on, drink up!

00:22.780 --> 00:25.680
<i>And as for me...</i>

00:26.270 --> 00:29.360
<i>I can feel a passionate gaze 
coming from next to me.</i>

00:29.620 --> 00:31.650
Um, is something wrong?

00:31.650 --> 00:33.830
A-Ah, excuse me.

00:33.830 --> 00:37.680
Oh, I was just thinking that 
you and I might be alike.

00:37.680 --> 00:39.730
Huh? In what way?

00:39.980 --> 00:42.590
Like how we always get dragged into things.

00:42.590 --> 00:44.120
A-Ah...

00:44.560 --> 00:49.410
On that note, I always see 
you with Professor Tear.

00:49.410 --> 00:52.250
You could say that we're stuck together.

00:52.250 --> 00:57.640
Truth is, I used to be a teacher for 
the Luseiannel household.

00:57.640 --> 00:58.320
What?

00:58.320 --> 01:00.640
You were Professor Tear's teacher?

01:00.640 --> 01:01.490
Yes.

01:01.840 --> 01:04.480
She's been like this from a young age,

01:04.480 --> 01:06.990
which, honestly, gave me trouble to no end.

01:07.240 --> 01:10.530
She was a bright child, who grasped 
ideas faster than I could teach her,

01:10.530 --> 01:15.250
and then came to me with hypotheses 
far exceeding even the material.

01:15.250 --> 01:18.060
Seeking out knowledge wherever 
her curiosity guided her,

01:18.060 --> 01:21.610
she managed to find success carrying 
out all sorts of experiments.

01:21.610 --> 01:25.080
After she'd done all she could at home,

01:25.080 --> 01:30.480
she enrolled in this academy, and I 
was assigned to keep an eye on her.

01:30.480 --> 01:35.560
Ultimately, she never did require 
my teachings to begin with.

01:35.560 --> 01:37.980
She is undoubtedly a genius.

01:37.980 --> 01:40.210
She has developed a number of new spells,

01:40.210 --> 01:45.280
and people said she was most deserving of 
the title of Sage, the highest in modern magic.

01:45.770 --> 01:48.010
So despite all of that...

01:48.360 --> 01:52.450
Why did she have to pursue 
ancient magic, of all things?!

01:53.050 --> 01:57.430
A lost branch of magic that 
might not even be useful!

01:57.430 --> 02:03.340
W-Well, we couldn't possibly fathom 
the thought process of a genius.

02:03.750 --> 02:05.090
You're right.

02:05.360 --> 02:07.850
I'm nothing more than mediocre.

02:07.850 --> 02:09.510
<i>It backfired!</i>

02:10.600 --> 02:12.590
<i>A-Awkward.</i>

02:13.150 --> 02:16.730
Hey, Haruto!

02:18.270 --> 02:21.240
Havin' fun?

02:19.970 --> 02:21.240
H-Hey!

02:25.830 --> 02:28.370
<i>Wait, she's been drinking!</i>

02:28.630 --> 02:30.340
Wahoo!

02:32.100 --> 02:33.170
What is it?

02:33.170 --> 02:36.510
<b>Grin</b>

02:33.450 --> 02:35.240
Wanna drink some, too?

02:35.240 --> 02:36.510
No, I'm fine.

02:37.190 --> 02:38.390
Ah, hey!

02:41.390 --> 02:43.720
<i>That was for </i>you<i>?!</i>

02:50.340 --> 02:52.080
Haruto!

02:52.080 --> 02:56.600
Thanks for joinin' the lab with me!

02:56.600 --> 02:58.390
Dweh!

02:58.390 --> 03:03.050
I think I can get stronger here...

03:08.890 --> 03:10.290
<i>She fell asleep.</i>

03:29.480 --> 03:32.860
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

04:41.670 --> 04:47.010
m 0 0 l 50 0 l 45 13 l -5 13

04:41.670 --> 04:47.010
Episode 12

04:41.670 --> 04:47.010
<b>Not a Bad Night</b>

04:49.590 --> 04:51.330
That should do it.

04:51.330 --> 04:52.910
Whee!

04:52.910 --> 04:55.570
Are you having fun, Haruto?

04:57.950 --> 05:03.370
Haruto, do you know why she insists 
on studying ancient magic?

05:03.370 --> 05:04.120
No.

05:04.490 --> 05:07.830
I found out during her mana 
assessment for the entrance exam.

05:07.830 --> 05:11.460
As it happens, she possesses every element!

05:11.460 --> 05:13.890
Do you know how rare that is?

05:13.890 --> 05:19.240
Yes, like a tried-and-true hero of legend, 
rising up from a commoner's life!

05:19.550 --> 05:22.600
However, real life doesn't 
work out so nicely.

05:22.900 --> 05:27.030
Unfortunately, her mana level is 5/35.

05:27.030 --> 05:30.440
She may still be young, 
but that's way too low.

05:30.440 --> 05:34.840
It may well be that her mana level 
won't increase any further.

05:36.430 --> 05:38.770
But she's still in her teens.

05:39.050 --> 05:41.700
I'm sure that's why she 
turned to ancient magic.

05:41.700 --> 05:46.140
Ancient magic comes from an age brimming 
with ancestors who were level 100.

05:46.140 --> 05:49.950
It may provide a clue 
to raising one's level.

05:49.950 --> 05:53.850
I had yet to conduct any research 
toward that end, either.

05:53.850 --> 05:57.290
I'm thrilled to have a 
new topic of research!

05:57.960 --> 06:00.910
To pursue the slightest of possibilities...

06:00.910 --> 06:03.810
What a beautiful thing that is.

06:06.600 --> 06:10.230
This alcohol's got me saying 
things I normally wouldn't!

06:10.230 --> 06:12.170
I should sleep, too.

06:12.950 --> 06:15.280
Huh? Um...

06:20.360 --> 06:23.640
<i>They all fell asleep before I realized it.</i>

06:29.340 --> 06:33.400
By tomorrow, everyone in school 
will know I called off the duel...

06:33.400 --> 06:36.790
After I went so far as to side 
with the Church of Lucifyra

06:36.790 --> 06:39.600
to ensure that Father 
would be the next king!

06:41.940 --> 06:45.390
<i>At this rate, all of my machinations 
will have been for naught!</i>

06:45.790 --> 06:48.080
Hafen House Special Assassin Unit!

06:49.620 --> 06:52.470
You understand what your mission is, right?

06:52.790 --> 06:57.470
Eliminate Haruto Zenfis and 
the other three, tonight!

06:57.470 --> 06:58.430
Yes!

07:07.300 --> 07:09.450
Situation report, now.

07:09.450 --> 07:10.290
Yes.

07:10.290 --> 07:12.890
The four targets are the only 
ones inside the mansion.

07:12.890 --> 07:15.510
They're gathered in the south-central 
room on the second floor,

07:15.510 --> 07:17.500
and there are signs of a celebration.

07:17.850 --> 07:20.340
Three of them are heavily 
inebriated from drinking.

07:20.340 --> 07:23.450
Haruto Zenfis has also 
fallen asleep on the sofa.

07:23.450 --> 07:25.350
We're fully protected against witnesses?

07:25.350 --> 07:26.170
Yes.

07:26.170 --> 07:31.000
We have ten men in position putting up a net 
for soundproofing and intruder detection.

07:31.000 --> 07:34.330
And we also have ten men 
from the Assault Unit.

07:34.610 --> 07:37.420
Twenty men gathered here 
from our elite forces.

07:37.940 --> 07:40.300
Failure is absolutely impossible here.

07:40.800 --> 07:42.920
Let us commence the operation!

07:42.920 --> 07:43.630
Yes!

07:50.270 --> 07:51.370
What's wrong?!

07:52.140 --> 07:54.480
M-My nose!

07:56.890 --> 07:59.620
It's like there's an invisible wall here.

07:59.620 --> 08:01.430
Check the surroundings!

08:08.230 --> 08:09.330
It's no use.

08:09.330 --> 08:12.430
It looks like it completely 
surrounds the building.

08:16.370 --> 08:17.820
Not even a scratch!

08:17.820 --> 08:19.470
Is this the work of magic?

08:20.770 --> 08:22.270
A door suddenly appeared!

08:22.600 --> 08:25.230
I heard this from Lord Schneidel.

08:25.230 --> 08:30.690
Close to Haruto Zenfis is someone called 
Shiva, who uses strange powers.

08:30.690 --> 08:32.200
Proceed with caution.

08:39.960 --> 08:42.570
Use your most powerful magic 
to destroy that door!

08:47.250 --> 08:48.840
What just happened?!

08:49.090 --> 08:52.290
Shiva... who in the world <i>is</i> he?!

08:52.630 --> 08:54.490
C-Captain!

08:55.750 --> 08:57.180
My word!

09:04.690 --> 09:06.730
Hone your senses!

09:06.730 --> 09:08.800
He must be somewhere nearby!

09:15.370 --> 09:16.240
There!

09:18.740 --> 09:19.880
Capture him!

09:23.680 --> 09:24.970
There's two of him?!

09:30.520 --> 09:33.310
<i>I didn't hear anything 
about multiple Shivas!</i>

09:33.580 --> 09:35.270
<i>How strange!</i>

09:35.270 --> 09:37.250
<i>Something is strange here!</i>

09:38.190 --> 09:39.340
Captain!

09:41.680 --> 09:43.780
N-No way!

09:44.140 --> 09:46.300
I-It can't be!

09:46.720 --> 09:49.010
D-Damn it!

09:49.010 --> 09:50.680
You've finally realized it?

09:55.580 --> 09:58.280
S-So <i>you're</i> Shiva!

10:01.040 --> 10:03.140
What?! I can't move!

10:03.500 --> 10:06.260
I've sealed the movement 
of all twenty of you.

10:06.260 --> 10:08.710
Wh-What'd you say?!

10:08.710 --> 10:11.890
But seriously, your boss...

10:11.890 --> 10:13.800
Sending assassins for this?

10:13.800 --> 10:15.290
You've <i>gotta</i> be kidding.

10:15.680 --> 10:17.550
Anyway, Captain.

10:18.010 --> 10:22.100
Time to make you spill the 
beans on everything you know.

10:26.600 --> 10:28.020
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

10:37.950 --> 10:40.780
They were under your orders, were they not?

10:40.780 --> 10:42.580
N-No!

10:42.580 --> 10:44.020
It wasn't me!

10:44.020 --> 10:45.860
I've never seen any of these people!

10:45.860 --> 10:48.210
Never seen them, huh?

10:49.080 --> 10:52.080
<i>Eliminate Haruto Zenfis and the other three!</i>

10:52.080 --> 10:54.690
Wh-What in the world is this spell?!

10:54.690 --> 10:55.770
A projection of the past?!

10:55.770 --> 10:56.920
That's impossible!

10:56.920 --> 10:59.210
Well, leaving that aside.

10:59.210 --> 11:00.130
You know...

11:00.130 --> 11:04.370
Sending all these people as assassins 
because of a grudge is complete overkill.

11:04.370 --> 11:07.890
I mean, it looks like the Vise Block 
didn't teach you anything.

11:08.300 --> 11:10.780
Looks like you need a real punishment.

11:13.060 --> 11:15.780
A-Are you going to kill me?

11:19.490 --> 11:21.150
Like hell I'm going to let you kill me!

11:22.290 --> 11:25.070
I am Schneidel Hafen!

11:25.070 --> 11:27.250
The man slated to be the 
king after the next king!

11:37.360 --> 11:39.620
Huh? Schneidel?

11:45.900 --> 11:46.870
<i>No way!</i>

11:46.870 --> 11:48.480
<i>What is this, an anime plot twist?!</i>

12:03.180 --> 12:06.900
<i>That mysterious syringe 
turned him into a monster.</i>

12:12.240 --> 12:15.000
<i>For now, I've gotten him 
outside the building.</i>

12:15.000 --> 12:17.520
<i>The question is, what do I do now?</i>

12:17.520 --> 12:20.170
<i>I really wish I could just 
pretend I didn't see this!</i>

12:22.720 --> 12:24.200
<i>Haruto!</i>

12:24.200 --> 12:25.250
Char.

12:25.250 --> 12:27.070
Children should be asleep at this hour.

12:27.070 --> 12:27.980
<i>You're right.</i>

12:27.980 --> 12:32.900
<i>I couldn't sleep because I thought 
you might be up to something!</i>

12:32.900 --> 12:37.060
Well, I <i>am</i> fighting a mysterious 
monster right now.

12:37.060 --> 12:39.320
<i>What kind of monster would that be?!</i>

12:39.320 --> 12:40.090
<i>Ah...</i>

12:40.580 --> 12:43.690
Ah, r-right!

12:43.690 --> 12:49.430
A certain organization experimented 
on a human and turned him into this!

12:49.430 --> 12:51.040
<i>H-How cruel...</i>

12:51.040 --> 12:54.510
<i>Haruto, isn't there any 
way you can save him?</i>

12:54.510 --> 12:55.200
Eh?

12:55.200 --> 12:58.260
Ah... let me think.

12:58.260 --> 12:59.620
I wonder if there's a way...

13:03.140 --> 13:04.660
<i>Fine, then.</i>

13:04.660 --> 13:06.500
<i>Guess I'll have to do it for Char.</i>

13:08.090 --> 13:09.790
I've got this!

13:09.790 --> 13:12.070
<i>I know you do, Haruto!</i>

13:26.490 --> 13:30.520
<i>Wow, he's well above even Gigan's strength.</i>

13:35.280 --> 13:37.160
How do you like <i>this</i>?!

13:39.950 --> 13:42.040
<i>This is getting me nowhere!</i>

13:42.520 --> 13:45.620
<i>I guess I should stop his arms...</i>

13:58.390 --> 14:01.150
Okay, what to do now...

14:10.020 --> 14:12.070
He tore off his own arms!

14:17.460 --> 14:18.820
<i>Ah...</i>

14:18.820 --> 14:21.530
<i>The type that can regenerate, huh?</i>

14:25.040 --> 14:27.120
How am I supposed to deal with this?!

14:27.550 --> 14:28.790
<i>Haruto!</i>

14:28.790 --> 14:31.550
<i>There's something weird about the monster!</i>

14:31.550 --> 14:34.570
Huh? He's been weird this 
whole time, actually.

14:34.890 --> 14:37.630
<i>It looks like he's shrunken a bit.</i>

14:37.630 --> 14:40.350
<i>His skin's become slightly paler, too.</i>

14:40.350 --> 14:41.310
It's true.

14:41.310 --> 14:44.980
So if we whittle away the 
parts that became huge,

14:44.980 --> 14:47.380
he'll return to his normal size?

14:47.380 --> 14:49.020
Great work, Char.

14:49.020 --> 14:50.480
I think this will work out.

14:50.480 --> 14:51.610
<i>I'm honored by your words!</i>

14:52.640 --> 14:55.860
In that case, time to go all-out!

14:56.570 --> 14:59.520
Thousand blades, forged in 
the flames of purgatory!

15:05.440 --> 15:08.840
Th-This is a new special attack!

15:08.840 --> 15:11.800
Become as fangs soaring through the sky,

15:11.800 --> 15:14.150
and rend my foes!

15:14.890 --> 15:19.100
Japanese Blades, Gather!

15:22.310 --> 15:24.810
Schneidel! Return to your old self!

15:24.810 --> 15:26.530
Go!

15:46.890 --> 15:48.190
He's back to normal.

15:49.690 --> 15:51.310
Char.

15:51.310 --> 15:53.570
He was saved because of you.

15:53.570 --> 15:54.710
Thank you.

15:54.710 --> 15:55.750
<i>You're welcome!</i>

15:55.750 --> 15:58.500
<i>I couldn't see some of it 
because of a mysterious light,</i>

15:58.500 --> 16:00.680
<i>but you really were able to turn him back!</i>

16:00.960 --> 16:04.770
<i>I'm glad I used light to hide 
the bits I can't let Char see.</i>

16:04.770 --> 16:07.810
<i>I'm sure I'll have very good dreams tonight!</i>

16:07.810 --> 16:09.320
Glad to hear it!

16:09.320 --> 16:11.780
<i>Well, good night!</i>

16:11.780 --> 16:13.520
Yeah, good night.

16:14.320 --> 16:17.610
<i>Okay, time for the clean-up work.</i>

16:20.360 --> 16:21.760
Schneidel.

16:21.760 --> 16:24.110
Getting back to our earlier conversation...

16:24.110 --> 16:24.790
Hmm?

16:26.950 --> 16:29.650
Hey, wait! Where are you going?!

16:35.120 --> 16:38.520
<i>Looks like he's not in 
any state to be talking.</i>

16:38.520 --> 16:42.010
<i>Guess I should grab that 
syringe that he used.</i>

16:42.850 --> 16:44.270
<i>That tired me out.</i>

16:44.270 --> 16:47.450
<i>Let's fix up the mansion real quick 
so I can get back and sleep.</i>

17:04.590 --> 17:08.610
I happen to find these 
surroundings pretty fun.

17:08.610 --> 17:10.650
How do <i>you</i> feel about it?

17:11.590 --> 17:16.180
I'm you, so I feel the same way.

17:19.090 --> 17:20.380
I see.

17:20.840 --> 17:24.970
Wait, you went through all that, 
and you're having <i>fun</i>?

17:24.970 --> 17:27.760
Well, it's... you know.

17:27.760 --> 17:29.820
I see, so you're a tsundere.

17:29.820 --> 17:33.600
Y-You think it's way better than our 
previous life too, don't you?

17:33.600 --> 17:35.650
Well, I can't deny that.

17:36.270 --> 17:39.230
We used to be shut-ins, 
but now we've changed.

17:39.230 --> 17:44.480
At some point, we began to think that 
being with others might not be so bad.

17:46.470 --> 17:48.530
It's way past the dorm curfew.

17:48.530 --> 17:50.950
You should just stay here for the day.

17:50.950 --> 17:53.640
You're really doing great, you know.

17:54.190 --> 17:55.010
See you.

18:08.140 --> 18:11.620
Have you seen any, well, 
ominous signs in the royal capital?

18:11.620 --> 18:13.070
Pardon?

18:13.070 --> 18:14.490
Anything will do.

18:14.300 --> 18:15.380
Yes, yes.

18:14.490 --> 18:16.700
Tell me what's going on in the capital!

18:15.380 --> 18:16.700
Yes, yes.

18:16.700 --> 18:18.120
What was that?!

18:18.120 --> 18:20.590
Need some assistance, lady?

18:21.030 --> 18:23.360
I'd be more than happy to talk with you.

18:23.360 --> 18:25.370
Why don't you come over this way?

18:25.370 --> 18:27.470
Something you can't discuss here?

18:27.470 --> 18:29.090
I see, very well.

18:29.090 --> 18:32.310
I'm glad you're so quick on the uptake.

18:35.380 --> 18:37.760
<b>Ding...</b>

18:37.770 --> 18:39.610
Let me ask you again.

18:39.610 --> 18:43.470
Can you tell us everything you know 
about happenings in the capital?

18:43.950 --> 18:45.390
Ah, yes.

18:47.920 --> 18:49.520
Interesting.

18:49.520 --> 18:52.200
The king and queen consort are on bad terms,

18:52.200 --> 18:55.780
and there is unrest among 
the aristocracy, as well.

18:56.300 --> 19:00.190
It seems my predictions 
proved correct after all.

19:00.190 --> 19:03.810
Danger is near at hand in the royal capital!

19:03.810 --> 19:05.520
I'm not sure about that...

19:05.520 --> 19:07.390
No, Miss Liza.

19:07.390 --> 19:09.870
The enemies have already mobilized.

19:10.170 --> 19:15.580
You saw my liege make short work 
of their vanguard, did you not?

19:15.880 --> 19:17.250
Lady Charlotte.

19:17.250 --> 19:19.630
Let us gaze once more upon that 
"footage," as you called it!

19:19.630 --> 19:21.060
Right away!

19:21.380 --> 19:22.320
Click!

19:26.750 --> 19:29.230
Haruto is so cool!

19:29.230 --> 19:30.300
Indeed.

19:30.300 --> 19:33.390
Some of it I can't see, thanks to 
that strange light partway through.

19:33.390 --> 19:36.740
But Lord Haruto's exploits are 
fantastic, even on repeated watches!

19:36.740 --> 19:39.840
To overwhelm the opponent, 
and yet show mercy!

19:37.190 --> 19:41.320
Lovely

19:39.840 --> 19:41.540
My liege is magnanimous, indeed!

19:41.540 --> 19:44.790
I feel like we've gotten off-topic.

19:44.790 --> 19:46.360
Well, whatever.

19:46.360 --> 19:48.320
Snore...

19:48.320 --> 19:52.740
According to Haruto, this person is the
 student council's vice president.

19:52.740 --> 19:55.440
This is purely conjecture on my part...

19:55.830 --> 20:01.460
But perhaps he was acting on orders 
from the hidden student council!

20:02.420 --> 20:06.080
The incident occurred after 
Haruto entered the academy.

20:06.080 --> 20:11.110
Which means they became aware of his powers, 
and accordingly set their plan into motion.

20:11.110 --> 20:12.770
It's the logical conclusion.

20:12.770 --> 20:16.530
And there can be no doubt that 
they're linked to the evil syndicate

20:13.270 --> 20:18.730
Student Council

20:14.770 --> 20:18.730
Hidden Student Council

20:14.770 --> 20:18.730
Hidden

20:16.270 --> 20:18.730
Evil Syndicate

20:16.440 --> 20:18.730
Villain

20:16.530 --> 20:18.740
that shakes the royal capital!

20:19.520 --> 20:21.350
And what if they are?

20:21.350 --> 20:24.700
No matter the foe, they stand 
no chance before Lord Haruto.

20:24.700 --> 20:28.040
That may be, but since we don't 
know where they could be hiding,

20:28.040 --> 20:29.590
it could end up being a burden.

20:29.590 --> 20:30.910
That's true.

20:30.910 --> 20:32.170
Which is why...

20:32.420 --> 20:36.140
I believe that now is 
the time for us to act!

20:36.140 --> 20:38.200
First, we infiltrate the academy.

20:38.200 --> 20:40.040
Then we gather intelligence.

20:40.040 --> 20:44.550
Finally, we expose those 
tied to the evil syndicate!

20:44.930 --> 20:48.010
We have willingly gathered 
here for this very moment!

20:48.010 --> 20:51.630
Let us all act as support 
for Haruto in his service!

20:51.950 --> 20:54.400
Meeting of the Round Table, to arms!

20:54.400 --> 20:56.360
Indeed. No objections here.

20:56.360 --> 20:59.140
Yes. All in service of my liege.

20:59.420 --> 21:00.800
Lady Charlotte.

21:00.800 --> 21:03.020
"Meeting of the Round Table" 
is what we call our meetings,

21:03.020 --> 21:05.450
so we should come up with 
a name for our group.

21:07.630 --> 21:10.610
Then we shall be known as Camelot.

21:10.920 --> 21:11.890
Yes.

21:11.890 --> 21:13.730
Then, one more time...

21:14.200 --> 21:16.830
Camelot, to arms!

21:21.030 --> 21:23.330
<i>Infiltrating the academy?!</i>

21:23.330 --> 21:26.660
<i>Things are really moving along without me!</i>

21:26.660 --> 21:29.940
<i>Still, an evil syndicate, huh?</i>

21:29.940 --> 21:33.560
<i>From what Professor Tear 
said, it really does exist.</i>

21:33.560 --> 21:37.560
<i>And I can't shake the feeling 
that she's involved.</i>

21:37.840 --> 21:40.390
<i>I'll need to be diligent with monitoring,</i>

21:40.390 --> 21:42.610
<i>so that Char and the others 
can safely investigate.</i>

21:43.200 --> 21:46.170
<i>It's all so I can live a nice, 
quiet life in seclusion.</i>

21:50.410 --> 21:51.890
<i>So be it.</i>

21:51.890 --> 21:52.870
<i>Let's do it.</i>
